# Tiered Cache — see docs/sistemas/cache-strategy.md and CLAUDE.md
# "Tiered Cache — SUPREME RULE #0" for full rationale.
#
# IMPORTANT — Cloudflare Pages behavior: rules are CONCATENATED, not
# overridden. A catch-all /* with no-store would prepend no-store to
# every other rule and override immutable (most restrictive wins per
# RFC 9111). So we DO NOT have /* fallback. Unmatched paths use CF
# Pages defaults (typically no caching for unclassified static files).
#
# Tier semantics:
#   A (Frozen)    immutable max-age=1y    content NEVER changes per filename
#   B (Versioned) immutable max-age=1y    filename includes content-hash (?v=)
#   C (Live)      no-cache                revalidate every visit (HTML)
#   Manifest/SW   no-cache, must-revalidate
#
# When multiple rules match the same path, headers concatenate; most-
# restrictive directive wins. Examples:
#   /shared/bundle-version.js matches both /shared/*.js (immutable) AND
#   /shared/bundle-version.js (no-cache, must-revalidate). Concatenated:
#   "public, max-age=..., immutable, no-cache, must-revalidate".
#   Browser: no-cache wins → always revalidates. CORRECT.
#
# Service Worker (sw.js) remains PURE PASS-THROUGH — see CLAUDE.md.

# =======================================================================
# Tier A — Frozen assets (content per filename never changes)
# These files are append-only: new files added, existing files never mutated.
# =======================================================================

# Audio library (~849MB across ~291 tracks; filename = canonical identity)
/shared/audio/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

# Font files (woff2; @font-face URLs are stable)
/shared/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

